{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a4945b32bde6b3610280d673c8385ea6.avif?t=1773357090\" width=268 height=188 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/d3c94aa2f4d288c25809cceddf5648d5.avif?t=1773357090\" width=268 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/9582b00417856692c8663bbab78ab7f6.avif?t=1773357090\" width=602 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What exactly is mobOS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>mobOS</strong> is an early 2000's internet exploration and life simulator that lives and breathes alongside you, all taking place inside of a fully featured Virtual Machine. Explore an evolving &amp; interactive web full of forums, downloadable software, web/downloadable games, and even make online friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as yourself exclusively. You don't play as any big-shot hero and you don't have to do a single thing that you don't want to do. What you choose to experience in <strong>mobOS</strong> is completely up to you, just like the real world wide web.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Wacky World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world outside of mobOS is a completely fictional  universe with many differences to the real world that is a ton of fun learn about and explore in. Fictional history, fictional video games, fictional TV shows, fictional game consoles and so much more to discover!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7185e87866ed5bcc1b432eaea558b5c.avif?t=1773357090\" width=844 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PICTURED</strong>: Delby holding The GameBall Machine Controller in his room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Virtual Machine / Workshop Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mobOS takes place inside of a fully featured Virtual Machine. All software inside of the game is written inside of the game itself, compiled to a form of bytecode that mobOS can read and interpret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/63814f4d522bd6c0a4462671fa74a1b2.avif?t=1773357090\" width=720 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For most players, you won't need to worry about this at all. This is not a programming game, but for those who want to make workshop content, you'll be able to directly in the game itself!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731270?t=1773357090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/1626d81a4a2f8911efcc5c1dcfa69fa536e1820b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773357090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/552ded0ca62959aa42911a09f6e7a3d4fc75ce7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773357090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/552ded0ca62959aa42911a09f6e7a3d4fc75ce7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773357090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound",