 to discover!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/a7185e87866ed5bcc1b432eaea558b5c.avif?t=1773357090\" width=844 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PICTURED</strong>: Delby holding The GameBall Machine Controller in his room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Virtual Machine / Workshop Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mobOS takes place inside of a fully featured Virtual Machine. All software inside of the game is written inside of the game itself, compiled to a form of bytecode that mobOS can read and interpret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/extras/63814f4d522bd6c0a4462671fa74a1b2.avif?t=1773357090\" width=720 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For most players, you won't need to worry about this at all. This is not a programming game, but for those who want to make workshop content, you'll be able to directly in the game itself!</p>","developers":["mob"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/cc07d3b6b2bde15c6994ed140ffd72df80332db3/header.jpg?t=1773357090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731270/178298600/a0eb21f35674e44105ea318b256897c1f56a9459/1772749820/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772750137","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731270/178298600/a0eb21f35674e44105ea318b256897c1f56a9459/1772749820/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772750137","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731270/178298600/a0eb21f35674e44105ea318b256897c1f56a9459/1772749820/hl