.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731270/be4627c8be5fa3e42b8aa126f4f25c2bd49ac3ae/ss_be4627c8be5fa3e42b8aa126f4f25c2bd49ac3ae.600x338.jpg?t=1773357090"}],"short_description":"Explore an open ended internet and operating system set in a 2000s alternate reality that changes over real life time depending on how you interact with it. Discover secrets through the web, download games, become an active member in communities and more. The world is at your fingertips.","steam_appid":3731270,"support_info":{"email":"mob@palmonds.dev","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/palmonds.dev"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}